    "diff_hunk": "@@ -367,6 +367,12 @@ requested operation.\n | 128-255 | Designated for custom use.\n |===\n \n+The `status.CODE` value of `0` is designated as the reset default. If a value of\n+`0` is returned in response to a command execution, the command should be\n+considered to have failed for UNSPECIFIED reasons. It is recommended that this\n+status code be returned only if all other defined status codes are determined to\n+be inapplicable.",
